[0.001, "o", "\u001b[0m\u001b[?7h\u001b[0;38;5;230mWith 12 people, tasks often belong to \"the team,\" which means nobody owns them. Deadlines get set top-down instead of by the person doing the work. \"Done\" means different things to different people, so work bounces back for rework.\u001b[0m\r\r\n\u001b[0m"]
